Finger (no metacarpal): 1 + 1 + 2 = 4.
Fingerpiece raw: 4 + 4 = 8.
Fingerpiece functional: 8 - 1 overlap = 7. That is 1 + 1 + 2 + 3 excl + 1 shared circle.
Width: 1 uniform. Taper deferred.
